# Copy to terraform.tfvars, which .gitignore already excludes.
# The RDS master password is not set here. RDS generates it and stores it in
# Secrets Manager. Remove db_password from an existing terraform.tfvars before
# the next apply, or Terraform rejects it as an undeclared variable.

# The pod panels need this agent. It adds about $1-$2 over a few hours.
